  "description": "Larry Edgar’s signature Aire frame was designed to go big and fast! Made from full 4130 Cr-Mo with tubing specs designed to help reduce the overall weight without sacrificing strength, the frame features internal and external gussets, multi-butted and tapered tubing, an Investment Cast seat post clamp with the Horizontal Cut System, EBS removable brake mounts and 6mm thick Investment Cast Dropouts with integrated chain tensioners.\nAvailable in a 20.8\" size with 13\" chainstays, or 21\" and 21.8\" sizes with a 13.8\" chainstays.\n\n• This product is covered with Lifetime Warranty.\n• EBS Brake kit NOT included\n• Replacement stickers included",
